@startuml
title Use Case Diagram - Cardiopulmonary Sound Separation Prototype

left to right direction
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "Student / Researcher User" as User

rectangle "Cardiopulmonary Sound Separation Prototype" {
  usecase "Upload cardiopulmonary\naudio" as UC1
  usecase "Validate audio file" as UC2
  usecase "Preprocess audio" as UC3
  usecase "Run sound separation" as UC4
  usecase "Generate heart sound\noutput" as UC5
  usecase "Generate lung sound\noutput" as UC6
  usecase "View result" as UC7
  usecase "Download outputs" as UC8
  usecase "View processing history" as UC9
}

User --> UC1
User --> UC7
User --> UC8
User --> UC9

UC1 .> UC2 : <<include>>
UC2 .> UC3 : <<include>>
UC3 .> UC4 : <<include>>
UC4 .> UC5 : <<include>>
UC4 .> UC6 : <<include>>
UC5 .> UC7 : <<include>>
UC6 .> UC7 : <<include>>
UC9 ..> UC7 : <<extend>>

note bottom of UC4
The prototype separates sounds only;
it does not provide diagnosis.
end note

@enduml
